            "title": "Voya Financial (VOYA): Earnings Decline Raises Doubts on Margin Recovery Narratives",
            "description": "",
            "summary": "Voya Financial (VOYA) reported a 14.9% annual decline in earnings over the past five years, with its current net profit margin at 6.2%, compared to 10.4% last year. While analysts project earnings growth of 13.5% per year going forward, this pace still trails the broader US market\u2019s expected 16% rate. Anticipated revenue growth of 4.4% per year also lags the national average of 10.5%. See our full analysis for Voya Financial. Next, we will compare Voya\u2019s reported numbers with the key...",
